      <div style="background:#000;padding:2rem;"><h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;"><a href="/fit-engineering-service" style="color:#fff;text-decoration:none;">Fit Engineering</a></h3><p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1rem;">Brand-specific fit blocks and fit consistency.</p><a href="/fit-engineering-service" style="font-size:0.8rem;color:#e00;text-decoration:none;">Learn more →</a></div>
